<title>FINLAND: G7 summit communique will include Russia - Summers.</title>
<headline>G7 summit communique will include Russia - Summers.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The communique from June's summit of Group of Seven industrial nations in Denver will be issued jointly by the Seven and Russia, Deputy U.S. Treasury Secretary Lawrence Summers said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The communique from the summit will come from the Eight,&quot; Summers told reporters after a U.S.-Russia summit. &quot;It is fair to say that there will be certain core financial issues that will continue to be discussed by the Seven. But other economic issues will be discussed by the Eight.&quot;</p>
</text>
